{{!-- subject: Reset your Nest Electronics password --}}
<h1 style="margin:16px 0 8px 0;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-0.02em;">
  Reset your password
</h1>

<p style="margin:0 0 4px 0;">Hello {{customerName}},</p>

<p style="margin:12px 0 0 0;color:#3f3f46;">
  We received a request to reset the password on your Nest Electronics account. Choose a new one
  using the link below.
</p>

{{> button url=resetUrl label="Choose a new password"}}

<p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#71717a;">
  This link expires in {{expiresIn}} and can be used once. If it has expired, request another from
  the sign-in page.
</p>

<p style="margin:16px 0 0 0;font-size:13px;color:#71717a;">
  If the button does not work, copy this address into your browser:<br />
  <span style="word-break:break-all;color:#3f3f46;">{{resetUrl}}</span>
</p>

<p
  style="margin:20px 0 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #f4f4f5;font-size:13px;color:#71717a;"
>
  If you did not ask for this, you can ignore this email — your password will not change and nobody
  can use this link without opening it from your inbox. Resetting your password signs you out
  everywhere, on every device.
</p>
